  <p>Every default gallery is one endless reverse-chronological scroll; once a photo scrolls past, it's gone. SnapAtlas replaces it with eight precise filter dimensions. Combine them and a moment sharpens into focus.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Year · month · day range · weekday · time of day</strong> — "2023 + May + Sat–Sun + Afternoon"</li>
    <li><strong>Orientation · source · custom date range</strong> too</li>
    <li>Pinch-zoom grid; long-press <strong>multi-select</strong> to delete, share or collage</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Place', title: '"I know I shot it here"<br>— on the map', soft: true, flip: true,
  shots: [
    { src: shots + '02_map_satellite.webp', alt: 'Photo clusters on the map', w: 720, h: 1280 },
    { src: shots + '03_place_detail.webp', alt: 'Tap a cluster to see that place as a grid', w: 720, h: 1280 }
  ] }) %}
  <p>Photos with GPS information appear on Google Maps automatically. After a trip you'll find yourself naturally asking, "What did I shoot here?"</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Automatic clustering</strong> by zoom — fifty shots from one neighborhood become a single "50" pin</li>
    <li>Tap a pin and <strong>every photo from that spot</strong> spreads out as a grid</li>
    <li>Far more intuitive than naming folders by location</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Auto Collage', title: 'The app picks the layout,<br>you keep the memories',
  shots: [
    { src: shots + '04_select.webp', alt: 'Multi-select photos for a collage', w: 720, h: 1280 },
    { src: shots + '05_auto_collage.webp', alt: 'Auto collage result with the style panel', w: 720, h: 1280 }
  ] }) %}
  <p>The biggest friction in collage apps is deciding which photos go where. Select several and SnapAtlas groups them by date and generates multiple collages in one shot.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li><strong>Auto-grouping by date</strong> — day, month, year or weekday</li>
    <li><strong>Automatic layout</strong> — 1–8 photos per grid, 1–4 grids per canvas</li>
    <li><strong>Style</strong> — background, margin, corners, date and place labels, patterns</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Library', title: 'Collages saved<br>as lightweight recipes', soft: true, flip: true,
