  <p>Each collage is saved as just the photo IDs and style parameters, so the library stays nimble. Open one later, tweak the background or roundness, and re-export.</p>
  <ul class="checks">
    <li>Sort by <strong>recent or name</strong>, rename the ones that matter</li>
    <li><strong>Duplicate</strong> to try "same photos, different style"</li>
    <li><strong>Multi-select</strong> to delete several at once</li>
  </ul>
{% endcall %}

{% call m.feat({ eyebrow: 'Export', title: 'Save to your gallery<br>or share right away',
